  "description": "MSBuild integration for the Daml C# code generator. A <DamlArchive> item (or a <DamlProject> built with dpm) generates C# bindings at build time. DamlCodegenMode=Standalone (the default) runs the bundled .NET DAR decoder and emitter, with no JDK; DamlCodegenMode=Dpm runs `dpm codegen-cs` (requires dpm >= 1.0.20 and a JDK on PATH). See https://github.com/peacefulstudio/canton-dotnet-sdk.",
